<Base title="About | DBZA Quotes">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>
    An unofficial fan reference for <a href="https://teamfourstar.com">TeamFourStar</a>'s
    <em>Dragon Ball Z Abridged</em>: search every line of dialog, link any moment, and share
    clips — all video plays through YouTube on TFS's own channel. This site hosts transcripts
    (from the community-contributed closed captions) and timestamps, nothing else.
  </p>
  <p>
    Not affiliated with TeamFourStar, Toei Animation, Funimation, or Shueisha. Dragon Ball Z
    is © Toei Animation; DBZA is TeamFourStar's parody under fair use.
  </p>

  <h2>How sharing works</h2>
  <p>
    Every clip link encodes a video + timestamp. “Copy YouTube link” gives a plain
    <code>youtu.be</code> URL that plays inline in Discord. Clip pages embed the official
    YouTube player with captions synced from the transcript.
  </p>

  <h2>Suggest clips</h2>
  <p>
    Anyone can create and share clip links freely. The curated catalog is moderated — use
    “Suggest for catalog” on any clip and a human reviews it.
  </p>

  <h2>Content removal / takedown</h2>
  <p>
    If you are a rightsholder (or TeamFourStar) and want any transcript or reference removed,
    email <a href="mailto:boolemilio@gmail.com">boolemilio@gmail.com</a> and it will be removed
    promptly — no formal process needed.
  </p>
</Base>
